IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `fpine-infringements`

-- Fines, Penalties and Infringement Notices Enforcement Act 1994 (WA), ss 12, 14-21H, 22-26, 46A-46C, 75, 101AA, r 2B, r 8, Schedule 2 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. The fees, remote areas and seizure limits
-- are taken from the deposited Fines, Penalties and Infringement Notices Enforcement Regulations 1994 (version 09-b0-00).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wa_fines-penalties-and-infringement-notices-enforcement-act-1994_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Facts from the WA lives (workbench scenarios au/wa/cradle-to-grave-jake, event k042). The scenario gives no modified
-- penalty, issuing officer or address detail beyond Perth: the $100 penalty is the encoder's, WA Police is assumed to be
-- the approved prosecuting authority, and Jake's address is taken to be in the metropolitan region.

